        "Description": "Welcome back to Dubai, 47.\r\rOur client, Carl Ingram, is fed up with the staff at the Burj Al-Ghazali&apos;s top penthouse suite. So, he has called for us to take care of them. He does not want to alert the royal Omar Al-Ghazali, so we must take care of these kills as accidents, or hide any melee kills. We must also avoid being seen doing illegal actions.\r\rGood hunting.",
